{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"(inf) `Oh, finally, someone who can [expletive] understand me!` they swoop down. `Oh hey, Secel. You will never guess what happened since we were last talking. Try me.`","created_at":"2021-07-18T15:30:18.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866341117455630337","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
