{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She looks at the bird, then sighs. `”Okay, who’s bright idea was it to let you drink from the bottle? You look like crap.”`","created_at":"2021-07-18T15:33:08.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866341832623128606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"`You think I look bad... yeah, you're right there. But get this, I go with Sab to visit some ravens, we get swooped at and next I know we're in her ~*~crush's~*~ airship and she's a frog!`","created_at":"2021-07-18T15:35:06.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866342326082994186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
