{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"It took her a moment to process the information. `”Sabrine has a crush?”` A smile spread across her face. `”That’s terrific! Who’s the lucky one?”`She then held up a hand. `”And… what do you mean ‘she’s a frog’?”`","created_at":"2021-07-18T15:38:04.243000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866343072010731570","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"they make an approximation of a shrug. `I don't [expletive] know, I just get back to this plane of existence and whoops! All frogs! And she's having trouble with her Common, too, but at least she can actually say things. If I try...` they try saying 'This happens.' in Common, but it comes out like 'Blighn ghkalsghkns.'","created_at":"2021-07-18T15:40:17.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866343630289895444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
